========================GS Resource Type Numbers========================Modification History:30-Mar-95 Dave Lyons	Allocated D800..DFFF for A2PRO (Tim Tobin / Lunatic Bruce						E'Sex, a2pro@genie.geis.com).21-Oct-92 Dave Lyons	Created file from 6.0 Interface files 6-Mar-93 DAL			Added $8102.==================================================================================Here is the list of globally-defined GS resource types.	      0000 = illegal	0001..7FFF = defined by individual applications	8000..FFFF = defined globallyThe globally-defined range breaks down like this:	8000..BFFF = defined by Apple engineering (see below)	C000..CFFF = defined by Apple DTS	D000..D7FF = defined by the Foundation developers (Marc Wolfgram et al)	D800..DFFF = defined by A2PRO (see above)    E000..FFFF = reserved for future allocation==================================================================================8001 = rIcon8002 = rPicture8003 = rControlList8004 = rControlTemplate8005 = rC1InputString8006 = rPString8007 = rStringList8008 = rMenuBar8009 = rMenu800A = rMenuItem800B = rTextForLETextBox2800C = rCtlDefProc800D = rCtlColorTbl800E = rWindParam1800F = rWindParam28010 = rWindColor8011 = rTextBlock8012 = rStyleBlock8013 = rToolStartup8014 = rResName8015 = rAlertString8016 = rText8017 = rCodeResource8018 = rCDEVCode8019 = rCDEVFlags801A = rTwoRects801B = rFileType801C = rListRef801D = rCString801E = rXCMD801F = rXFCN8020 = rErrorString8021 = rKTransTable8022 = rWString8023 = rC1OutputString8024 = rSoundSample8025 = rTERuler8026 = rFSequence8027 = rCursor8028 = rItemStruct8029 = rVersion802A = rComment802B = rBundle802C = rFinderPath802D = rPaletteWindow802E = rTaggedStrings802F = rPatternList8102 = used by HyperCard IIgsC001 = rRectListC002 = rPrintRecordC003 = rFontWithin a Teach file, type $7001 records the window position & size, and types$7100..7FFF can be used freely by 3rd parties, provided they use resource namesto make sure the resource is really theirs before interpreting it.[end of document]